#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced techniques - Qiskit addons {#advanced-techniques-qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Técnicas avançadas - Addons do Qiskit {#advanced-techniques-qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit addons are a collection of research capabilities for enabling algorithm discovery at the utility scale. These modular software components build on Qiskit’s performant foundation and can plug into a [workflow](/guides/intro-to-patterns) to scale or design new quantum algorithms. This page highlights the available tools across key functional categories to help you choose relevant capabilities when building your workflows.\n"
msgstr "Os addons do Qiskit são uma coleção de capacidades de pesquisa para possibilitar a descoberta de algoritmos em escala utilitária. Esses componentes de software modulares se constroem sobre a base de alto desempenho do Qiskit e podem ser integrados a um [fluxo de trabalho](/guides/intro-to-patterns) para escalar ou projetar novos algoritmos quânticos. Esta página destaca as ferramentas disponíveis nas principais categorias funcionais para ajudá-lo a escolher as capacidades relevantes ao construir seus fluxos de trabalho.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map domain problems {#map-domain-problems}"
msgstr "Mapeie problemas de domínio {#map-domain-problems}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These capabilities specialize in mapping domain problems into quantum operators and circuits for execution on a quantum computer.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      description=\"Model optimization problems and map them into representations that can be understood by a quantum computer.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"Essas capacidades se especializam em mapear problemas de domínio em operadores e circuitos quânticos para execução em um computador quântico.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Mapeador de otimização\"\n"
"      description=\"Modele problemas de otimização e mapeie-os em representações que possam ser compreendidas por um computador quântico.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      description=\"Model fermionic quantum systems and map them to qubit operators and circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-fermions/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Mapeador fermiônico\"\n"
"      description=\"Modele sistemas quânticos fermiônicos e mapeie-os em operadores de qubit e circuitos.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-fermions/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      description=\"Construct high-fidelity circuits with reduced depth using approximate quantum compilation with tensor networks.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      description=\"Construa circuitos de alta fidelidade com profundidade reduzida usando compilação quântica aproximada com redes tensoriais.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Multi-product formulas\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce the Trotter error of Hamiltonian dynamics through a weighted combination of several circuit executions.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mpf/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: MPF\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Fórmulas multi-produto\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduza o erro de Trotter na dinâmica hamiltoniana por meio de uma combinação ponderada de várias execuções de circuitos.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mpf/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: MPF\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr "</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize circuits for hardware execution {#optimize-circuits-for-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Otimize circuitos para execução em hardware {#optimize-circuits-for-hardware-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "These capabilities are useful for reducing circuit depth and typically come with an increased sampling overhead.\n"
#| "<CardGroup>\n"
#| "    <Card\n"
#| "      title=\"Operator backpropagation\"\n"
#| "      description=\"Reduce circuit depth in expectation value estimations by backpropagating observables through the circuit.\"\n"
#| "      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-obp/\"\n"
#| "      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: OBP\"\n"
#| "      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
#| "    />\n"
msgid ""
"These capabilities are useful for reducing circuit depth and typically come with an increased sampling overhead.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Operator backpropagation\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce circuit depth in expectation value estimations by backpropagating observables through the circuit.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-obp\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: OBP\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"Essas capacidades são úteis para reduzir a profundidade dos circuitos e geralmente vêm com uma sobrecarga de amostragem aumentada.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Retropropagação de operadores\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduza a profundidade do circuito em estimativas de valores de expectativa retropropagando observáveis pelo circuito.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-obp/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: OBP\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce the depth of transpiled circuits by decomposing entangling gates between non-adjacent qubits.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-cutting\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Corte de circuitos\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduza a profundidade de circuitos transpilados decompondo portas de entrelaçamento entre qubits não adjacentes.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-cutting\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage noise for expectation value estimation {#manage-noise-for-expectation-value-estimation}"
msgstr "Gerencie ruído para estimativa de valores de expectativa {#manage-noise-for-expectation-value-estimation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the following addons to manage noise when building quantum workloads that estimate expectation values of observables.\n"
msgstr "Use os seguintes addons para gerenciar ruído ao construir cargas de trabalho quânticas que estimam valores de expectativa de observáveis.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<CardGroup>\n"
#| "  <Card\n"
#| "      title=\"Propagated noise absorption\"\n"
#| "      description=\"Mitigate expectation values by measuring a target observable that has absorbed noise model information.\"\n"
#| "      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/\"\n"
#| "      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PNA\"\n"
#| "      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
#| "    />\n"
#| "    <Card\n"
#| "      title=\"Shaded lightcones\"\n"
#| "      description=\"Reduce probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) sampling overhead by removing noise model terms that have low impact on the observable estimation.\"\n"
#| "      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/\"\n"
#| "      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SLC\"\n"
#| "      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
#| "    />\n"
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Propagated noise absorption\"\n"
"      description=\"Mitigate expectation values by measuring a target observable that has absorbed noise model information.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-pna\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PNA\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Shaded lightcones\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) sampling overhead by removing noise model terms that have low impact on the observable estimation.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-slc\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SLC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Absorção de ruído propagado\"\n"
"      description=\"Mitigue valores de expectativa medindo um observável alvo que absorveu informações do modelo de ruído.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PNA\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Cones de luz sombreados\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduza a sobrecarga de amostragem do cancelamento probabilístico de erros (PEC) removendo termos do modelo de ruído que têm baixo impacto na estimativa do observável.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SLC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

